WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 4=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:41.439 --> 01:42.439
Starting today,

01:43.519 --> 01:45.640
you are third-class maids
of Zhichun Hall.

01:46.472 --> 01:48.040
Your monthly allowance is 500 coins.

01:49.079 --> 01:50.400
Four of you will share a room.

01:50.904 --> 01:52.936
You'll each receive
two sets of clothes per season.

01:53.799 --> 01:56.799
Food, clothing, lodging, and travel

01:57.519 --> 01:58.599
must all follow the rules.

01:59.840 --> 02:01.599
- Yes, Qingxiang.
- Yes, Qingxiang.

02:06.719 --> 02:07.640
This room

02:07.920 --> 02:09.199
needs someone in charge.

02:09.919 --> 02:10.520
Who'll do it?

02:22.680 --> 02:23.599
Qingxiang,

02:23.919 --> 02:24.960
how about me?

02:26.919 --> 02:27.719
All right.

02:28.552 --> 02:30.000
From now on, everyone in this room

02:30.199 --> 02:31.240
will listen to Ji'er.

02:33.639 --> 02:34.360
Follow me.

02:39.208 --> 02:40.360
A tyrant at home.

02:52.104 --> 02:53.910
This is where
the second-class maids live.

02:54.560 --> 02:55.599
Two to a room.

02:55.919 --> 02:58.000
Their monthly allowance is 800 coins.

02:59.159 --> 02:59.879
Someday,

03:00.520 --> 03:02.919
I hope I can become a second-class maid.

03:04.280 --> 03:05.800
Work hard and do your duties well,

03:05.879 --> 03:07.240
and your dream will come true.

04:00.168 --> 04:01.360
(Jinzhan, Second-Class Maid)

04:01.360 --> 04:02.280
(of Zhichun Hall)
Qingxiang.

04:04.840 --> 04:05.639
Yingge.

04:06.136 --> 04:07.800
You said you know how to tend flowers.

04:08.360 --> 04:10.439
Jinzhan is in charge
of the plants here.

04:10.560 --> 04:11.639
Starting today,

04:11.840 --> 04:13.159
you'll work under her.

04:13.400 --> 04:14.360
No slacking off.

04:16.519 --> 04:17.079
Yes.

04:19.839 --> 04:20.519
The rest of you,

04:21.160 --> 04:21.800
come with me.

04:44.639 --> 04:45.399
Xiaolian.

04:47.752 --> 04:49.510
Since you don't know
how to do anything yet,

04:50.160 --> 04:52.040
start by helping out
in the small kitchen.

04:52.560 --> 04:53.736
Whatever they tell you to do,

04:53.879 --> 04:54.800
do it.

05:02.279 --> 05:02.879
Yes.

05:03.480 --> 05:04.519
Thank you, Qingxiang.

05:06.199 --> 05:06.759
Follow me.

05:15.839 --> 05:16.480
Baogai.

05:19.680 --> 05:20.480
Qingxiang.

05:23.240 --> 05:24.480
This is the tea room.

05:24.959 --> 05:26.079
Baogai is in charge here.

05:29.100 --> 05:31.560
(Baogai,
Second-Class Maid of Zhichun Hall)

05:31.560 --> 05:34.200
You two will start by learning
to tend the stove and boil water.

05:34.240 --> 05:35.040
Remember,

05:35.096 --> 05:37.000
there must always
be hot water in the kettle

05:37.279 --> 05:38.160
so the masters can

05:38.160 --> 05:39.720
have tea
or wash up whenever they need.

05:39.839 --> 05:40.680
Don't let it go cold.

05:43.304 --> 05:45.120
Don't touch
the tea leaves or medicinal herbs

05:45.120 --> 05:46.079
in the cabinet.

05:46.536 --> 05:48.600
If even
the smallest amount goes missing,

05:48.839 --> 05:49.920
you'll be held responsible.

05:52.079 --> 05:53.199
- Yes.
- Yes.

05:56.680 --> 05:58.360
As if we'd steal from the masters.

06:09.120 --> 06:10.439
You're third-class maids.

06:10.456 --> 06:12.760
You're not qualified
to serve the masters personally.

06:14.600 --> 06:16.190
Keep your heads down and do your work.

06:16.360 --> 06:17.560
Don't get any improper ideas.

06:18.399 --> 06:19.079
Otherwise,

06:19.600 --> 06:20.879
don't blame me for being harsh.

06:25.000 --> 06:25.839
Take care.

06:27.976 --> 06:29.870
What's wrong
with being third-class maids?

06:29.920 --> 06:31.720
First Madam
personally asked for us to...

06:34.079 --> 06:35.000
Get to work.

06:36.480 --> 06:37.920
Clean all the stoves inside.

06:39.439 --> 06:40.240
Hurry.

06:44.800 --> 06:45.480
Baogai,

06:45.480 --> 06:46.480
I'll fetch the water.

07:36.079 --> 07:37.360
(Zijin, Zhao Xingtang's)
Young Lady is upset.

07:37.360 --> 07:38.240
(First-Class Maid)

07:38.240 --> 07:39.439
She's throwing a tantrum.

08:08.968 --> 08:09.680
Young Lady.

08:10.088 --> 08:11.870
Counting your silver
to calm yourself again?

08:14.000 --> 08:14.959
In this Lin Residence,

08:17.480 --> 08:18.959
this is the only thing I find lovable.

08:26.199 --> 08:27.839
Only when I see it

08:28.720 --> 08:30.680
can I endure

08:30.920 --> 08:32.320
another day in this prison.

08:50.480 --> 08:52.080
I've met all four women

08:52.080 --> 08:53.320
First Madam sent over.

08:54.240 --> 08:56.320
Yingge is calm and composed.

08:56.919 --> 08:59.679
Someone like her is either on our side

09:00.200 --> 09:01.320
or against us.

09:01.919 --> 09:04.200
Xiaolian is lively.

09:05.000 --> 09:06.519
Just as she said,

09:06.559 --> 09:07.919
all she thinks about is food.

09:09.159 --> 09:10.480
Lanxiang...

09:13.720 --> 09:15.320
is as guileless as Xiaolian,

09:16.039 --> 09:17.360
but more timid.

09:19.200 --> 09:20.000
As for Ji'er,

09:22.000 --> 09:23.240
she certainly is ambitious.

09:29.550 --> 09:31.608
First Madam despises me
for not bearing children,

09:32.519 --> 09:35.519
so she wants them
to bear heirs for the Lin family.

09:38.216 --> 09:39.530
If I really had to choose someone

09:39.544 --> 09:41.240
to bear Lin Jinqi a child,

09:45.279 --> 09:46.360
I'd rather choose you.

09:47.039 --> 09:47.840
Young Lady,

09:48.799 --> 09:49.759
I don't want to.

09:55.360 --> 09:56.519
Even if you agreed,

09:56.960 --> 09:58.559
Lin Jinqi wouldn't.

10:02.679 --> 10:03.639
He wants the child

10:04.600 --> 10:05.679
to bear the Lin name,

10:07.000 --> 10:08.240
not the Zhao name.

10:15.799 --> 10:16.399
Then

10:18.039 --> 10:19.559
what do you plan to do?

10:26.399 --> 10:27.200
What can I do?

10:30.240 --> 10:31.480
I'm just a woman.

10:32.799 --> 10:34.399
I can't go to the academy,

10:36.159 --> 10:37.919
nor can I make something of myself.

10:39.600 --> 10:40.879
All I can do is save money

10:44.240 --> 10:45.720
and find another way out.

10:56.279 --> 10:58.919
Lanxiang's sachet is already worn out.

11:00.480 --> 11:02.279
I've finished sewing her a new one.

11:03.039 --> 11:05.519
I was going to wait
for an auspicious day to give it to her.

11:08.000 --> 11:09.639
That girl's embroidery

11:11.559 --> 11:12.720
is always so lovely.

11:16.279 --> 11:17.559
She'd surely say again

11:18.600 --> 11:20.639
that I'm like
a mother admiring her daughter,

11:21.559 --> 11:24.279
so everything
she does looks wonderful to me.

11:26.440 --> 11:28.159
But really, she's the one

11:29.600 --> 11:30.960
who cheers me up every day.

11:34.399 --> 11:35.720
If it hadn't been for her

11:37.720 --> 11:39.279
giving me the will to carry on,

11:43.559 --> 11:44.919
perhaps six years ago,

11:45.480 --> 11:47.039
I would've followed our daughter

11:47.639 --> 11:48.480
into the next world.

11:53.840 --> 11:55.519
What can we even do for her?

11:57.519 --> 11:59.919
All we've done is burden her
by making her serve others.

12:01.159 --> 12:02.120
Even now,

12:02.759 --> 12:04.039
we don't know which household

12:04.120 --> 12:05.279
she's been assigned to

12:05.519 --> 12:06.600
or what work she's doing.

12:07.360 --> 12:09.600
I wonder if anyone is mistreating her.

12:23.440 --> 12:25.279
What are you doing?

12:32.519 --> 12:33.320
Look.

12:35.384 --> 12:36.960
Do you still remember this character?

12:39.879 --> 12:41.840
It looks a little familiar.

12:44.360 --> 12:45.519
"Live."

12:49.240 --> 12:50.320
"Live?"

12:50.420 --> 12:57.000
(Live)

12:57.000 --> 12:58.679
Wasn't this

12:59.304 --> 13:00.990
the last thing
Lanxiang's mother left her?

13:01.720 --> 13:03.879
And it's also what Lanxiang gave us.

13:04.399 --> 13:05.000
She said

13:05.480 --> 13:07.320
no matter
which household she's assigned to,

13:07.840 --> 13:09.279
no matter what work she has to do,

13:09.279 --> 13:11.440
she'll live on and live well.

13:11.799 --> 13:13.720
So you need
to pull yourself together, too,

13:13.840 --> 13:15.240
and live well.

13:19.919 --> 13:21.279
Mind your own business.

13:23.080 --> 13:24.919
My life is as tough as a weed.

13:25.279 --> 13:26.480
I've seen it all.

13:27.480 --> 13:28.679
The harder life tramples me,

13:29.120 --> 13:30.639
the stronger I grow.

13:36.320 --> 13:37.360
Stay put and rest.

13:38.320 --> 13:39.200
Your hands are filthy.

13:41.480 --> 13:43.200
I don't have time to keep getting sick.

13:44.080 --> 13:45.919
I still need to save money for Lanxiang.

13:45.919 --> 13:47.940
♪Flowers bloom again by the fence♪

13:48.300 --> 13:52.060
♪Snow falls white upon the eaves♪

13:54.120 --> 13:56.480
Slow down.

13:57.260 --> 14:00.460
♪Whose footsteps come and go?♪

14:03.000 --> 14:03.759
Persimmons!

14:04.120 --> 14:05.279
These are fresh.

14:05.360 --> 14:06.879
Look how fresh they are.

14:10.480 --> 14:11.279
Persimmons!

14:11.559 --> 14:13.759
Beautiful and delicious
rouge persimmons!

14:13.759 --> 14:18.140
♪People gather, then part♪

14:28.840 --> 14:30.159
Lanxiang, hurry up.

14:30.200 --> 14:31.704
Everyone's waiting for your charcoal.

14:54.399 --> 14:55.080
You two,

14:55.288 --> 14:56.780
one takes the first half of the night,

14:56.792 --> 14:58.216
and the other takes the second half.

14:58.360 --> 14:59.399
The fire mustn't go out.

14:59.400 --> 15:00.830
There must always
be hot water in the kettle.

15:00.840 --> 15:01.639
Yes.

15:03.320 --> 15:04.080
Yes.

15:07.128 --> 15:08.936
How many times have you said that?

15:09.032 --> 15:09.840
Aren't you tired?

15:17.759 --> 15:19.480
I'm exhausted after working all day.

15:20.000 --> 15:20.639
I need a rest.

15:22.679 --> 15:24.159
Bring a pot of water to our room.

15:24.184 --> 15:25.848
We've been serving
Young Madam all day.

15:25.928 --> 15:27.690
We're exhausted
and want to soak our feet.

15:27.759 --> 15:29.580
(Lucao,
Second-Class Maid of Zhichun Hall)

15:35.720 --> 15:36.720
I'll take it over.

15:37.039 --> 15:38.279
I'll go back and get some sleep.

15:38.488 --> 15:40.120
I'll come relieve you after midnight.

15:49.639 --> 15:50.200
Hurry.

15:50.440 --> 15:51.720
Young Madam needs hot water.

15:52.360 --> 15:53.720
Why is there nothing on the stove?

15:54.984 --> 15:56.840
What have you been doing?
If Young Madam holds

15:56.879 --> 15:59.000
you responsible, can you
bear the consequences?

16:08.279 --> 16:09.360
The water we boiled earlier

16:09.360 --> 16:10.808
is right here for when we need it.

16:11.080 --> 16:12.584
It's just the right temperature now.

16:12.616 --> 16:14.280
Hurry and boil some more water.

18:06.200 --> 18:07.000
Father,

18:08.440 --> 18:11.519
my hands are covered in charcoal dust,
just like yours.

18:13.720 --> 18:15.599
Mother would nag me again if she saw.

18:42.440 --> 18:43.240
(Lanxiang,)

18:44.119 --> 18:45.400
(Father will remember.)

18:46.720 --> 18:48.000
(Live well.)

18:49.559 --> 18:51.160
(Let's all live well.)

19:15.799 --> 19:17.160
I slept right through,

19:17.160 --> 19:18.559
and you didn't even wake me.

19:19.480 --> 19:20.759
Baogai said

19:20.760 --> 19:22.648
someone has to stay
by the stove at all times.

19:23.119 --> 19:24.200
I didn't dare leave.

19:25.928 --> 19:27.480
If you're too timid to get any sleep,

19:27.480 --> 19:28.519
you can't blame me.

19:29.720 --> 19:31.160
No one needed water during the night,

19:31.440 --> 19:32.640
so I kept dozing off, too.

19:32.880 --> 19:33.839
I'm not sleepy at all.

19:35.799 --> 19:37.279
Must be nice for you.

19:38.039 --> 19:40.279
Our room was freezing last night.

19:40.280 --> 19:42.488
Even in my dreams,
I was looking for a fire to warm up.

19:50.000 --> 19:50.759
These accounts

19:52.279 --> 19:53.200
are well kept.

19:54.519 --> 19:55.920
There isn't a single error.

19:56.664 --> 19:58.616
Thank you for your praise, Young Master.

19:59.759 --> 20:01.079
Your only son

20:01.384 --> 20:03.288
must be
of marriageable age now, isn't he?

20:03.720 --> 20:05.119
Thank you for asking, Young Master.

20:06.079 --> 20:07.480
He's already married.

20:08.000 --> 20:09.160
Whose daughter

20:09.240 --> 20:10.664
was lucky enough to marry him?

20:12.400 --> 20:13.839
Her name is Lancao.

20:18.160 --> 20:21.160
She was Young Madam's dowry maid.

20:23.160 --> 20:25.000
She is indeed fortunate.

20:25.519 --> 20:27.480
It's all thanks to you, Young Master.

20:47.079 --> 20:47.519
Please...

20:48.720 --> 20:49.559
Please, Young Master,

20:49.759 --> 20:51.559
spare me.

20:55.559 --> 20:58.599
Are there any errors
in these account books?

20:59.624 --> 21:02.430
We have fine Hangzhou white chrysanthemums
right here in the residence,

21:02.440 --> 21:03.960
yet she insists we pick them fresh,

21:03.960 --> 21:05.279
calling it an elegant pastime.

21:05.559 --> 21:08.119
I think Qingxiang is just showing off

21:08.119 --> 21:09.119
and making work for us.

21:09.359 --> 21:11.839
She's obviously a maid just like us,

21:11.960 --> 21:13.519
but just because she can read a little,

21:14.079 --> 21:16.160
she puts on airs like a young lady.

21:16.440 --> 21:17.240
Bah.

21:18.880 --> 21:20.279
Walls have ears.

21:20.279 --> 21:21.519
Someone might hear you.

21:28.160 --> 21:29.319
Can't you read, too?

21:30.648 --> 21:32.600
Young Madam
was too impatient to listen before,

21:32.630 --> 21:34.360
so you didn't
get the chance to tell her.

21:34.376 --> 21:35.750
Now you can find an opportunity

21:35.759 --> 21:36.799
to tell her.

21:37.559 --> 21:38.319
Maybe Young Madam

21:38.344 --> 21:40.568
will take a liking to you
and put you to good use.

21:43.200 --> 21:44.000
I wouldn't dare.

21:44.920 --> 21:47.160
I'm afraid Young Madam won't like me,

21:47.359 --> 21:49.319
and I'll only make Qingxiang dislike me.

21:52.216 --> 21:53.720
You're only bold with your own people.

21:54.008 --> 21:56.168
You only act tough in front of me.

21:56.216 --> 21:57.990
The moment you meet
someone truly formidable,

21:58.359 --> 21:59.599
you can barely get a word out.

22:09.640 --> 22:11.400
I'll keep your secret for you,

22:13.079 --> 22:13.880
but

22:14.880 --> 22:16.960
you'll have to listen to me from now on.

22:21.519 --> 22:22.559
You have my word.

22:26.119 --> 22:28.319
When I, Lv Ji'er,
give my word, I keep it.

22:28.519 --> 22:29.599
Absolutely.

22:43.119 --> 22:45.279
You can't just pick flowers
from the garden.

22:46.319 --> 22:47.720
Which household are you from?

22:49.519 --> 22:50.319
Miss,

22:50.720 --> 22:52.240
we're from Young Master's household.

22:53.759 --> 22:54.680
What a coincidence.

22:54.690 --> 22:55.990
I have a Buddhist scripture here.

22:56.000 --> 22:57.720
Please take it back
to Zhichun Hall for me.

23:01.940 --> 23:04.380
(Diamond Sutra)

23:09.279 --> 23:10.319
Take it back.

23:11.759 --> 23:13.680
Tell him Old Madam
sent it to Young Master.

23:13.790 --> 23:15.432
Find a suitable place to enshrine it.

23:18.839 --> 23:19.839
Don't worry.

23:20.240 --> 23:21.000
I'll personally

23:21.000 --> 23:23.096
deliver this Buddhist scripture
to Young Master.

23:32.980 --> 23:35.100
(Diamond Sutra)

23:41.119 --> 23:42.240
It's going to rain soon.

23:42.400 --> 23:43.559
Let's hurry back.

23:47.119 --> 23:48.200
I know a shortcut.

23:48.200 --> 23:49.279
Let's take it back.

23:49.559 --> 23:51.799
We can't let
this Buddhist scripture get wet.

23:52.079 --> 23:52.720
All right.

24:14.319 --> 24:15.440
Are you blind?

24:15.599 --> 24:17.039
Watch where you're going!

24:28.119 --> 24:29.359
You're the blind one!

24:30.312 --> 24:32.160
Why are you running like someone's died?

24:45.540 --> 24:46.860
(Outstanding debt: 1,000 taels.
Outstanding debt: 100 taels)

24:46.860 --> 24:49.300
(Outstanding debt: 500 taels.
Debtor: Liu San)

24:52.060 --> 24:54.380
(Diamond Sutra)

25:02.648 --> 25:05.150
Thank goodness the scripture
wasn't stained or damaged.

25:05.160 --> 25:07.368
Otherwise, how could
I answer to Young Master?

25:11.000 --> 25:11.920
Here's yours back.

25:12.799 --> 25:13.960
I'd rather pick my own.

25:16.440 --> 25:17.359
I'm heading back first.

25:18.119 --> 25:19.599
It's fine if the flowers get wet,

25:19.599 --> 25:20.680
but not the scripture.

25:21.160 --> 25:22.359
It's for Young Master.

25:22.480 --> 25:23.656
We can't be careless with it.

25:24.920 --> 25:25.519
Ji'er.

25:27.000 --> 25:27.720
What?

25:29.992 --> 25:31.720
I'm running an errand for Young Master.

25:32.799 --> 25:34.720
As soon as you get back,
take the scripture

25:34.720 --> 25:36.519
to Young Master
and Young Madam's room.

25:37.704 --> 25:38.830
You don't have to tell me.

25:40.968 --> 25:42.310
Take your time picking them up.

25:48.720 --> 25:50.519
As the head shopkeeper
of Rongbao Pavilion,

25:50.559 --> 25:53.079
you'd even take
the twenty taels from my family.

25:53.519 --> 25:55.119
Either you urgently need money,

25:55.119 --> 25:56.240
or

25:56.880 --> 25:58.880
someone is going
to inspect the accounts.

26:18.160 --> 26:19.240
Are there any errors

26:20.039 --> 26:21.279
in these account books?

26:25.319 --> 26:27.000
Yes. There are.

26:28.480 --> 26:29.480
Where?

26:30.799 --> 26:31.720
I don't know.

26:34.559 --> 26:35.920
I really don't know.

26:36.119 --> 26:37.519
These transaction accounts

26:37.519 --> 26:39.519
were all handed over to Qingxiang,

26:39.519 --> 26:40.680
Young Madam's maid.

26:40.880 --> 26:43.079
I only did as I was told.

26:43.519 --> 26:45.599
I really don't know.

26:45.680 --> 26:47.920
I really don't know.

27:01.599 --> 27:02.440
Why are you kneeling?

27:03.000 --> 27:03.799
Sit down and talk.

27:05.448 --> 27:06.550
Thank you, Young Master.

27:08.008 --> 27:09.160
Thank you, Young Master.

27:10.519 --> 27:12.359
Zijin, Young Madam's maid,

27:13.039 --> 27:15.000
brought me two jars
of Eight Treasure Tea.

27:16.070 --> 27:18.440
It's even made with white
chrysanthemums from the garden.

27:19.119 --> 27:20.720
It's perfect for this time of year.

27:23.519 --> 27:26.079
It clears internal heat
and relieves dryness.

27:27.319 --> 27:28.200
Try some.

27:28.839 --> 27:29.799
If you like it,

27:30.400 --> 27:31.559
take a few jars home.

27:33.400 --> 27:35.416
Thank you
for your generosity, Young Master.

28:02.160 --> 28:03.400
I've been away for many years.

28:04.799 --> 28:07.119
For now, I don't want
something this trivial

28:07.920 --> 28:09.440
to cause an argument
with Young Madam.

28:11.559 --> 28:12.559
I understand.

28:13.279 --> 28:15.119
I'll make sure Young Madam
never finds out.

28:16.880 --> 28:20.240
I burned this hand myself

28:20.640 --> 28:23.000
when I dozed off by the brazier.

28:24.519 --> 28:26.039
Young Master knows nothing about it.

28:26.160 --> 28:28.000
Young Master even praised my work

28:28.024 --> 28:29.640
and rewarded me with Eight Treasure Tea.

28:34.680 --> 28:35.880
You know what to say.

28:43.440 --> 28:44.240
Go.

28:45.464 --> 28:46.510
Thank you, Young Master.

28:47.304 --> 28:48.240
Thank you, Young Master.

30:01.119 --> 30:02.119
Hurry and work it out.

30:02.160 --> 30:03.559
How much did we make this month?

30:23.119 --> 30:23.799
What's wrong?

30:29.200 --> 30:30.000
Young Lady.

30:30.720 --> 30:32.480
I...

30:34.000 --> 30:35.279
Speak properly.

30:35.768 --> 30:37.660
If kowtowing and kneeling
could solve problems,

30:37.672 --> 30:38.750
I wouldn't be here.

30:44.279 --> 30:44.920
I...

30:46.319 --> 30:47.359
I took the wrong one.

30:47.799 --> 30:48.880
The wrong one?

30:52.559 --> 30:53.359
Then what's this?

30:55.519 --> 30:56.119
It's...

30:56.799 --> 30:58.160
It's a real Buddhist scripture.

31:01.832 --> 31:02.880
A Buddhist scripture?

31:03.144 --> 31:04.440
Then where's the account book?

31:05.839 --> 31:06.640
The account book...

31:07.720 --> 31:08.839
On my way back,

31:08.920 --> 31:10.008
I didn't want any trouble,

31:10.056 --> 31:11.368
so I deliberately took a shortcut.

31:14.856 --> 31:17.100
I ran into two third-class maids
from our household,

31:17.119 --> 31:18.240
Ji'er and Lanxiang.

31:18.839 --> 31:19.759
It must've been them.

31:19.896 --> 31:21.950
I mistakenly brought
the Buddhist scripture back,

31:21.960 --> 31:23.480
and they took the account book.

31:26.472 --> 31:27.720
Why are you still kneeling?

31:28.359 --> 31:29.359
Get Madam Feng

31:29.432 --> 31:30.550
and go catch the thieves.

31:31.600 --> 31:33.079
They dared to steal from their master.

31:33.440 --> 31:34.200
Tie them up,

31:34.200 --> 31:35.759
gag them, and sell them off.

31:38.184 --> 31:40.310
Are we supposed
to wait until Lin Jinqi returns

31:41.240 --> 31:42.839
and let him deal with us?

31:48.820 --> 31:50.580
(Diamond Sutra)

32:02.100 --> 32:04.980
(Feng Cang'er,
Zhao Xingtang's Housekeeper)

32:36.264 --> 32:38.088
Why haven't you taken
the Buddhist scripture

32:38.104 --> 32:39.224
to Young Madam yet?

32:39.768 --> 32:41.480
The Buddhist scripture
is for Young Master,

32:41.480 --> 32:43.039
not Young Madam.

32:43.839 --> 32:44.960
If Young Master isn't here,

32:45.440 --> 32:46.960
shouldn't you give it to Young Madam?

32:47.496 --> 32:49.550
The maid from Old Madam's
household made it clear.

32:49.550 --> 32:51.352
This Buddhist scripture
is for Young Master.

32:51.440 --> 32:53.496
Of course I'll personally
give it to Young Master.

32:53.580 --> 32:55.540
(Diamond Sutra)

32:56.000 --> 32:57.039
Is it pretty?

33:00.119 --> 33:01.480
I'm warning you, Xu Lanxiang.

33:01.576 --> 33:04.040
This is my errand. Don't even
think about taking it from me.

33:12.440 --> 33:14.350
You're just delivering
a Buddhist scripture.

33:14.350 --> 33:15.820
It's not like you're delivering
the Buddha himself.

33:15.830 --> 33:17.432
I wouldn't dream of taking it from you.

33:17.576 --> 33:18.790
At least you know your place.

33:24.152 --> 33:25.752
- Young Madam.
- Young Madam.

33:47.140 --> 33:49.780
(Diamond Sutra)

33:54.620 --> 33:57.540
(Outstanding debt: 1,000 taels.
Outstanding debt: 100 taels)

34:09.079 --> 34:11.239
What were you
just saying about my errand

34:11.239 --> 34:12.400
and your errand?

34:13.119 --> 34:14.119
What's going on?

34:18.760 --> 34:20.000
When we were picking flowers,

34:20.360 --> 34:22.760
we met a maid
from Old Madam's household.

34:23.400 --> 34:24.719
She instructed me

34:25.039 --> 34:27.119
to give this Buddhist scripture
to Young Master.

34:27.352 --> 34:29.896
She said Young Master
should find a place to enshrine it.

34:30.039 --> 34:31.360
On my way back,

34:31.480 --> 34:33.559
I accidentally bumped into Qingxiang

34:34.119 --> 34:35.119
and fell.

34:35.119 --> 34:36.239
My clothes got muddy.

34:36.328 --> 34:38.872
I was afraid of appearing
before Young Madam in such a state,

34:39.000 --> 34:41.760
so I thought I'd come back
and change into clean clothes first.

34:42.320 --> 34:43.559
Once I was presentable,

34:43.719 --> 34:45.159
I'd take the Buddhist scripture

34:45.280 --> 34:47.320
to Young Master
and Young Madam's room.

35:02.199 --> 35:03.000
And you?

35:04.079 --> 35:06.320
You're soaked through
and your feet are covered in mud.

35:07.280 --> 35:08.840
Where have you been?

35:10.159 --> 35:11.159
Young Madam,

35:11.160 --> 35:13.450
when I went to deliver
the chrysanthemums to the tea room,

35:13.460 --> 35:14.760
it started raining.

35:15.000 --> 35:16.599
Baogai told me to come back

35:16.599 --> 35:18.000
and change into clean clothes.

36:05.719 --> 36:07.480
Young Madam
can't bear children herself,

36:08.159 --> 36:09.480
yet she's so jealous.

36:09.624 --> 36:10.984
She knows full well that us...

36:13.760 --> 36:15.719
First Madam
sent me here for Young Master,

36:15.864 --> 36:17.896
yet Young Madam
keeps such a close watch on him.

36:17.928 --> 36:20.264
She won't give me
the slightest chance to get near him.

36:27.880 --> 36:29.079
I'm talking to you.

36:29.160 --> 36:30.920
Why aren't you saying anything?

36:36.239 --> 36:38.280
Baogai is still waiting
for me to get back to work.

36:40.760 --> 36:42.320
Perfect. Take that basket of flowers

36:42.320 --> 36:43.199
with you.

36:43.400 --> 36:44.840
Tell her I got caught in the rain

36:44.840 --> 36:47.624
and my chest feels uncomfortable,
so I need to lie down for a while.

36:59.599 --> 37:01.079
No wonder you mixed them up.

37:01.519 --> 37:02.840
(Diamond Sutra)
These two books

37:03.320 --> 37:04.360
would look the same

37:05.840 --> 37:07.639
to someone who can't read.

37:09.560 --> 37:12.110
I meant to disguise
the account book as a Buddhist scripture

37:12.184 --> 37:13.336
to keep others from noticing,

37:13.519 --> 37:15.639
but I ended up fooling myself.

37:16.679 --> 37:18.000
Put the account book away safely.

37:18.120 --> 37:19.280
As for the Buddhist scripture,

37:19.360 --> 37:20.239
when the rain stops,

37:20.480 --> 37:21.880
have Zijin deliver it.

37:22.480 --> 37:24.119
I don't want to see Lin Jinqi.

37:35.119 --> 37:37.800
Why didn't you
punish Ji'er and Lanxiang?

37:39.280 --> 37:40.119
Zijin,

37:41.768 --> 37:43.510
you've been with me
since you were little.

37:43.599 --> 37:45.599
You've grown taller, but no wiser.

37:46.280 --> 37:47.719
You're still as foolish as ever.

37:49.440 --> 37:51.320
If Ji'er had known it
was an account book,

37:51.559 --> 37:53.599
she never would've
gone back to change her clothes

37:53.679 --> 37:54.719
and tidy herself up.

37:55.360 --> 37:56.679
Since she had no idea what it was,

37:57.199 --> 37:58.679
why should we make a fuss

37:58.719 --> 37:59.559
and draw attention?

38:00.280 --> 38:00.960
Later,

38:01.016 --> 38:03.540
Young Madam will pass the Buddhist
scripture on to Young Master,

38:03.559 --> 38:06.079
and that will settle the matter.

38:08.639 --> 38:09.760
I understand now.

38:10.400 --> 38:11.480
Ji'er and Lanxiang,

38:11.719 --> 38:12.400
like me,

38:12.440 --> 38:13.360
can't read.

38:13.416 --> 38:15.544
They were convinced it
was a Buddhist scripture.

38:16.599 --> 38:18.239
One was bold enough

38:18.280 --> 38:20.600
to use it as a chance
to get close to Young Master,

38:20.664 --> 38:21.840
while the other was too timid

38:22.000 --> 38:23.400
to compete with Ji'er,

38:24.584 --> 38:26.320
so she simply
went to deliver the flowers.

38:41.160 --> 38:43.368
Do we have any more
of the new Eight Treasure Tea?

38:43.480 --> 38:44.280
Yes.

38:44.344 --> 38:46.424
Young Master
has finished his Eight Treasure Tea.

38:46.456 --> 38:48.030
You two, hurry

38:48.056 --> 38:49.280
and take some to Sanjue Hall.

38:49.400 --> 38:50.600
Young Master is waiting for it.

38:51.840 --> 38:52.679
We'll go right away.

39:01.280 --> 39:02.639
Qingxiang told us

39:02.760 --> 39:04.119
that we're third-class maids

39:04.920 --> 39:07.280
and can't enter the masters' rooms
to serve them personally.

39:08.159 --> 39:09.519
Can't you see no one's here?

39:09.800 --> 39:11.704
Then let's wait
for Baogai to come back.

39:12.056 --> 39:13.280
What if Young Master gets angry

39:13.400 --> 39:14.639
while we're waiting for her?

39:16.880 --> 39:17.639
Hurry.

39:17.800 --> 39:18.760
Young Master is waiting.

39:22.199 --> 39:22.880
Move.

39:23.039 --> 39:24.159
Don't ruin my chance.

40:15.199 --> 40:16.000
Where's Ji'er?

40:18.599 --> 40:20.480
A young servant
came with a message just now,

40:20.490 --> 40:22.860
saying Young Master was waiting
for his Eight Treasure Tea.

40:22.880 --> 40:24.540
Ji'er wanted
to wait for you to come back,

40:24.559 --> 40:26.519
but the young servant
kept urging her to hurry.

40:26.520 --> 40:28.220
Ji'er didn't dare
keep Young Master waiting,

40:28.230 --> 40:30.440
so she had no choice
but to take a jar of tea over.

40:32.808 --> 40:35.144
That must've been Jiugao,
Young Master's attendant.

40:42.639 --> 40:43.880
It's just a jar of tea.

40:44.670 --> 40:46.376
If Young Master needed it so urgently,

40:46.440 --> 40:48.079
Jiugao could've taken it back himself.

40:48.880 --> 40:50.440
Why make us deliver it?

40:51.679 --> 40:53.199
They really can't stand to see us idle.

41:04.760 --> 41:05.599
It's always safer

41:06.039 --> 41:08.079
to keep your feet firmly on the ground.

41:11.880 --> 41:12.519
Stay here.

41:12.630 --> 41:13.768
I'm going out for a while.

41:22.320 --> 41:23.639
I'll ask Qingxiang

41:23.704 --> 41:26.632
if we should send Young Master
a few more jars of Eight Treasure Tea.

41:59.280 --> 42:00.440
Look. What is this?

42:02.079 --> 42:02.920
Money?

42:04.079 --> 42:05.679
You're becoming a bigger fool.

42:05.880 --> 42:08.400
This is money
given to me by Young Master.

42:10.630 --> 42:12.776
You get money
just by delivering him a pot of tea?

42:13.400 --> 42:15.960
Young Master said
I'm capable and quick-witted.

42:18.880 --> 42:19.840
Young Master asked me

42:19.880 --> 42:21.400
why the Young Madam came to our place

42:21.400 --> 42:22.840
in the pouring rain yesterday.

42:23.320 --> 42:25.079
I told him about the sutra.

42:26.079 --> 42:28.599
Now, Young Master
will surely remember my name.

42:30.679 --> 42:32.840
Young Madam also remembers your name.

42:36.239 --> 42:37.559
So what if she does?

42:40.000 --> 42:41.719
First Madam sent me here.

42:42.280 --> 42:43.639
As long as Young Master likes me,

42:44.599 --> 42:45.159
surely

42:45.160 --> 42:46.630
she wouldn't dare offend First Madam

42:46.719 --> 42:47.599
and Young Master.

42:54.400 --> 42:55.440
I heard

42:56.039 --> 42:58.119
Young Madam Liu on Taiping Street

42:58.159 --> 42:59.559
beat a maid to death.

43:05.150 --> 43:07.500
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:10.440 --> 43:12.239
This is what happens

43:12.312 --> 43:14.632
to those with wicked intentions
who betray their masters.

43:15.360 --> 43:16.760
Young Madam said

43:17.320 --> 43:19.119
you should all take a good look

43:19.119 --> 43:20.840
and remember this well.

43:22.360 --> 43:23.639
Have you seen clearly?

43:25.440 --> 43:26.480
Yes.

43:28.079 --> 43:29.480
- Yes.
- Yes.

43:42.760 --> 43:44.079
You are

43:44.840 --> 43:46.480
Lanxiang's parents?

43:53.239 --> 43:54.440
My father is Xu Wanquan.

43:54.760 --> 43:55.920
My mother is Xue Guihua.

43:56.159 --> 43:57.280
My name is Xu Lanxiang.

44:12.860 --> 44:16.980
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:19.820 --> 44:24.340
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:25.620 --> 44:29.540
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:30.220 --> 44:32.980
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:33.700 --> 44:36.020
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.100
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:40.620 --> 44:44.860
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:47.780 --> 44:51.940
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:53.740 --> 44:57.300
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:57.300 --> 45:00.860
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

45:01.660 --> 45:07.340
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

45:07.700 --> 45:12.020
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:12.380 --> 45:15.340
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:15.340 --> 45:19.100
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:19.100 --> 45:21.980
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:21.980 --> 45:26.060
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:26.060 --> 45:29.420
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:29.420 --> 45:33.180
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:33.180 --> 45:37.180
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:37.940 --> 45:42.100
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:42.100 --> 45:45.540
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:45.540 --> 45:49.180
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:49.180 --> 45:52.060
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:52.060 --> 45:56.140
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:56.140 --> 45:59.500
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:59.500 --> 46:03.140
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

46:03.140 --> 46:10.940
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
